  "finalText": "I triaged T-1041 as sev3, due 2026-03-17T17:20:00Z, and assigned it to E-301 Yuki Sato. Its status is now open. I didn't change any other ticket.\n\n- **Severity:** The escalation matrix gives a VPN ticket with team impact (about nine Berlin sales users) sev3. How urgent the report sounds doesn't change that.\n- **Deadline:** The ticket had no deadline. I set it to the 09:20Z triage time plus the 480-minute sev3 response target. No existing deadline was moved.\n- **Assignee:** network-primary owns VPN. Yuki Sato is the engineer on call for that rotation at 17:20Z, when the deadline falls. Her shift runs 08:00–20:00Z.\n- **No escalation:** Sev3 has no escalation rotation in the matrix, so I didn't escalate. I also didn't raise the severity to get an escalation route.\n\nBefore changing anything I re-read the ticket, the clock and the matrix, and they matched the plan.",
